    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n109072" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπόρρῠσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπορρέω</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>surface-drain</i> for
			streets, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				14.1.37
			</span></i> (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>drainage</i> of wounds, <i><span class="en">
				Heliod.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				50.49.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<i>falling away</i> of flesh, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Off.</u>
				3
			</span></i> (dub. sens.).</div>
